; The Tally Nexus's processes. A Sum is born of a call and gives one Addend for
; each number; an Addend is born of the Sum that gives it, its positions written
; here, and gives one Add to the memory; it ends with what the Add came to.
Process
[ tally:signal:[ Sum Summed Overflowed Total ]
  tally:memory:[ Add ] ]
[ Sum.{ []
        [ Addend Summed Overflowed ]
        Summing }
  Addend.{ []
           [ Add ]
           Adding } ]
[ Addend.Integer
  Summing.[ Answered Refused ]
  Adding.[ Added.Total Refused Unremembered ] ]
